---
description: SalkarsaUI design system rules for all UI code (responsive web, Tailwind v4 and shadcn/ui)
globs: ["**/*.{tsx,jsx,ts,js,vue,svelte,astro,css,scss,html,mdx}"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow @DESIGN.md and @AGENTS.md for every UI change. Exact sizes, radius, spacing steps and breakpoints are in DESIGN.md.

- Colors: shadcn aliases (bg-primary, text-muted-foreground, border-border) or semantic tokens (bg-(--bg-subtle)). No hex values, no palette classes like bg-blue-500, no primitive tokens.
- Spacing: the steps in DESIGN.md section 2.2. Type: the .text-* classes.
- Components: the shadcn component mapped in DESIGN.md section 4, with the variants and sizes listed there.
- Build mobile first (base, then md:, then lg:). Include every state in DESIGN.md section 3.1.
- Dark mode uses data-theme="dark" or .dark, with the same token names.
